<!DOCTYPE html><html> <head>  <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initialscale=1.0" />  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />  <style type="text/css">@media screen and (max-width: 480px) {slot[style] {margin-right: 0 !important;}.columnDiv {margin-right: 0 !important;}}@media screen and (min-width: 480px) {slot[style] {margin-bottom: 0 !important;}.columnDiv {margin-bottom: 0 !important;}}</style>  <style type="text/css">@media screen and (max-width: 480px) {.contentbuilderBaseColumnRow .columnCell {display:inline-block;width:100%}}</style>  <style type="text/css">.contentpageDefaultEmailTemplatePageTemplate .contentRoot {width: 600px;}@media only screen and (max-width: 480px) {.contentpageDefaultEmailTemplatePageTemplate .contentRoot {width: 320px;}}</style> </head> <body>  <table class="contentpageDefaultEmailTemplatePageTemplate" style="background-color: #E9EAEC;" role="presentation" id="contentpage_emailTemplateBodyContent" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">       <tr>     <td width="100%" align="center">      <table class="contentRoot" style="background-color: #FFFFFF;" role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">               <tr>         <td style="padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;">          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">                       <tr valign="top">             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">                               <tr>                 <td>                  <table style="width:100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">                                       <tr>                     <td align="Center"><img src="" alt="" width="600" style="width: 100%; display: block; border: none; max-width: 100%; object-fit: fill;" /></td>                    </tr>                                     </table></td>                </tr>                             </table></td>            </tr>                     </table>          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">                       <tr valign="top">             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">                               <tr>                 <td>                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">                                       <tr>                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><br /><br /> Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},<br /><br /> I am Pastor Paul, School Administrator for AK9I.&nbsp; Thank you for stopping by our booth at the Ft. Bragg job fair.&nbsp; I hope my representative was thorough and informative in explaining our K-9 training programs and the post-graduation employment opportunities that are available to you.&nbsp;<br /><br /> To begin your new career journey and discover your post-military purpose, enrollment is a simple process.&nbsp; Simply fill out the student enrollment form, email it back to me or Michelle Hartman along with a copy of your high school diploma, GED or college transcripts. Additionally, you can fill out&nbsp;<br /><br /> If you have never applied for your Post 9-11 G.I. Bill education benefits, go to&nbsp;<a href="https://www.va.gov">www.va.gov</a> , fill out and electronically submit VA FORM 22-1990 (initial application for GI Bill benefits). That's really all there is to enroll.&nbsp; We do all the VA processing for you.&nbsp;<br /><br /> We are also approved to accept Skillbridge and VR&amp;E.&nbsp; Classes start the first Monday of every month except July which will be Tuesday July 7.&nbsp;<br /><br /> If you have any additional questions about our K-9 training program and post-graduation employment opportunities, or if you would like to schedule a tour of our facility, please call me or sign up online.&nbsp;<br /><br /> &nbsp;</td>                    </tr>                                     </table></td>                </tr>                             </table></td>            </tr>                     </table>          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">                       <tr valign="top">             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">                               <tr>                 <td>                  <table style="border: 0; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;" locked="0">                                       <tr>                     <td style="mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;">                      <div style="word-break:break-word; border: 0; mso-border-alt: 0; text-align:center; ">                       <div style="display: inline-block; border: 0; mso-border-alt: 0; ">                        <a href="https://outlook.office365.com/book/Bookings@ccasora.onmicrosoft.com/?ismsaljsauthenabled=true" style="direction:ltr;display:block;text-align:center;margin:0; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px; padding-top: 10px;padding-right: 20px;padding-bottom: 10px;padding-left: 20px; color:#ffffff;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;border:0;background-color:#F40505;border-radius:0px;mso-padding-alt:0;" target="_blank"><!--[if mso]><i style="background-color:#F40505; letter-spacing: 20px; mso-text-raise: 10px; mso-font-width: -100%;">&nbsp;</i><![endif]--><span>Schedule a Tour</span><!--[if mso]><i style="background-color:#F40505; letter-spacing: 20px; mso-text-raise: -10px; mso-font-width: -100%;">&nbsp;</i><![endif]--></a>                       </div>                      </div></td>                    </tr>                                     </table></td>                </tr>                             </table></td>            </tr>                     </table>          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">                       <tr valign="top">             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">                               <tr>                 <td>                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">                                       <tr>                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><br /><br /> Warm regards,<br /><br /> Pastor Paul<br /> &nbsp;<br /> LT Paul Roushia, USN (Retired)<br /> School Administrator<br /> AK9I<br /> 757-788-1524</td>                    </tr>                                     </table></td>                </tr>                             </table></td>            </tr>                     </table></td>        </tr>             </table></td>    </tr>     </table> </body></html>